9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,020
In order to solve the problem, Brother Tong

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,080
Our lunch question

11
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,080
By the way, I helped Liu Qingsi’s mother vent her anger.

12
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,080
